<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>
<main class="py-4">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-10">
            <h1 class="fw-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-muted mb-4">
                <em>This is a project/app demo policy for educational purposes. It is not legal advice.</em>
            </p>

            <p>
                Welcome to WanderLust. This Privacy Policy explains how this demo application
                handles information when you use the site.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>
                We may store non-personal information such as browser type, device information,
                pages visited, and time spent on the site. If you contact us directly, we may
                receive additional information such as your email address.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Cookies and Sessions</h3>
            <p>
                WanderLust uses session cookies to keep you logged in and to store flash messages
                and preferences. These cookies are required for the application to function.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Third-Party Services</h3>
            <p>
                This demo uses Cloudinary for image hosting and Google Maps for location display.
                Your uploaded images are stored by Cloudinary, and map requests are served by
                Google. Please review their respective privacy policies for details.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Consent</h3>
            <p>
                By using this demo application, you consent to this Privacy Policy and agree to
                its terms.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
